8,Ata in Papua New Guinea people group profile | Joshua Project,https://joshuaproject.net/index.php/people_groups/15882/PP,"The Ata are associated with the Pele?Ata language (also called Ata or Wasi), a Papuan language distinct from the Austronesian languages of many coastal groups. Linguists consider Pele?Ata to be part of a proposed Yele?West New Britain language group...",Pele-Ata,Yele-West New Britain
